uction (agency filmed on-site): Rs 10,000-30,000 per Reel (higher production value + graphics + b-roll + interview format). Doctor-led viral series (interview + long-form + edited to shorts): Rs 20,000-60,000/session yielding 6-15 Reels. Bundled into full marketing retainer typically more cost-effective than per-Reel pricing. ITD bundles."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What compliance rules apply to dermatology Reels + viral content in Kalyan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"ASCI medical advertising code + Maharashtra Medical Council norms apply. Compliant Reels approach: (1) education-first (explain condition/procedure without guaranteeing outcome), (2) before-after must include patient consent + individual-results-may-vary disclaimer + same lighting/angle/time, (3) no comparative claims against other clinics/products/doctors, (4) no guaranteed outcome language ('will clear your acne' → 'may help improve acne'), (5) no prescription-drug promotion, (6) testimonials with signed consent + verified. In Kalyan, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + KDMC enforcement."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do Reels drive patient inquiries for a Kalyan dermatology clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reels → profile visit → DM inquiry OR link-in-bio → WhatsApp/booking. Typical conversion funnel: 100K Reel reach → 500-2,000 profile visits → 30-150 DM inquiries → 8-40 qualified leads → 3-15 booked consultations → 2-8 treated patients (over 30-60 day cycle). Reels-attributed revenue: Rs 30,000-3 lakh per viral Reel over 30-60 day attribution window for Kalyan dermatology clinic. Compounds when Reel remains discoverable via hashtag + search for 3-12 months."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which Reels + short-form platform matters most for Kalyan dermatology?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Instagram Reels 50-60% of allocation (primary discovery + native to buyer + brand-safe algorithm). YouTube Shorts 15-25% (long-tail discovery + evergreen + video-search-adjacent). TikTok 10-15% (growing India but ASCI-compliance uncertainty means some clinics avoid). Facebook Reels 5-10% (secondary distribution). In Kalyan with Middle-class Marathi + Gujarati + Sindhi (Ulhasnagar-adjacent) + Mumbai commuter + salaried + trader families, Instagram Reels dominant. Cross-post to YouTube Shorts + Facebook for 3x distribution at zero incremental cost."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does trending audio + hashtag strategy work for dermatology Reels?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Trending audio: match to procedure/condition topic. Trending audio Reels get 2-4x higher initial push from algorithm than original audio. Rotate through top-100 trending audio weekly. Hashtag stack: 3-5 hyperlocal (#DermatologistThane #ThaneSkinCare), 3-5 category (#DermatologistIndia #SkinCareTips), 3-5 procedure (#HydraFacial #LaserHairRemoval), 2-3 trending. In Kalyan, hyperlocal + Marathi/Hindi hashtags amplify reach."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we handle patient consent + before-after documentation for viral Reels?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Signed consent form before filming (patient signs release with named use — Reels + Instagram + YouTube + Facebook + website). Before-after protocol: same lighting + same angle + same distance + same time-of-day + no filters + minimum 4-week interval + disclaimer overlay. Faces blurred if patient prefers. Individual-results-may-vary disclaimer on-screen + in caption + always. Consent revocable — patient can request removal any time. In Kalyan, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + KDMC enforcement of consent + ethics norms."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What common Reels mistakes damage Kalyan dermatology clinics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"(1) Guaranteed outcome language. (2) Before-after without consent + disclaimer. (3) Poor video quality (blur + shaky + bad audio). (4) Text-only Reels (algorithm penalises). (5) No trending audio (miss algorithm boost). (6) Weak hooks in first 3 seconds. (7) Repetitive templates + no variety. (8) No CTAs (DM/booking link missing). (9) Comparative claims. (10) Prescription-drug promotion. (11) Aggressive discount + urgency marketing. (12) English-only in Kalyan where Marathi + Hindi Reels outperform."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD produce Reels for Kalyan dermatology clinics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Monthly Reels calendar (8-25 pieces/month depending on tier), scripts written in-house, filmed either at clinic (agency team on-site) or agency-provided shot list for clinic-filmed, edited by dedicated Reels editor with music + captions + on-screen text + compliance review. Trending audio + hashtag + Marathi/Hindi captions per Marathi + Hindi + English + Gujarati + Sindhi. Weekly performance review + trend adaptation. Bundled with full marketing retainer (Rs 25,000-1.5 lakh)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we start Reels + viral content with ITD for a Kalyan dermatology clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free 30-min discovery. We audit your current Reels + benchmark against top 5 Kalyan dermatology clinics + identify highest-viral topics + share 30-day Reels calendar + tier recommendation within 3 working days."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is expected Reels growth trajectory for a Kalyan dermatology clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Month 1-3: baseline building (Reels reach 2K-50K per piece typical). Month 3-6: first viral hits (100K-1M pieces emerging). Month 6-12: consistent viral cadence (1-3 pieces per month hitting 500K+ reach). Month 12+: compounding — evergreen viral pieces continue driving inquiries for 12-24 months. Follower growth 300-2,000/month, patient inquiries 30-200/month by month 12."}}]}</script>
