      <p>Reels + short-form viral content drive 50-70% of new-patient discovery for scaling dermatology clinics in Kalyan, Maharashtra in 2026. Instagram Reels + YouTube Shorts + TikTok reach non-followers via algorithm — the single fastest patient-acquisition channel for dermatology when compliance-safe content is executed well. This FAQ answers 12 questions Kalyan dermatologists ask about Reels + viral content production.</p>
