    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What Reels + viral content strategy works for a Kalyan dermatology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Winning Reels formats for dermatology: (1) Condition-education (30-60s explainer on acne + pigmentation + eczema + hair fall — 2-5M reach potential when trend-audio matched), (2) Myth-busting (skincare myths + procedure myths + ingredient myths — high save + share), (3) Procedure-explainer (HydraFacial + laser + peels + Botox — 15-30s condensed process), (4) Before-after compilation (compliance-safe with disclaimer), (5) Doctor-personality + BTS + Q&amp;A + patient reactions, (6) Trending audio + fashion-adjacent + wedding + festive skincare tips (Diwali + wedding season + Winter + Monsoon + Ganesh Chaturthi + Gudi Padwa), (7) Duet + collab with beauty creators + estheticians + wellness accounts. In Kalyan with Middle-class Marathi + Gujarati + Sindhi (Ulhasnagar-adjacent) + Mumbai commuter + salaried + trader families, Reels reach 5,000-2M per piece depending on virality + topic.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How many Reels per month should a Kalyan dermatology clinic produce?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Boutique clinic (Rs 3-8 lakh/month revenue) 6-10 Reels/month baseline. Growth (Rs 8-40 lakh/month) 12-25/month for algorithm compounding. Enterprise (Rs 40 lakh+/month) 25-60/month for viral velocity + multi-doctor content. Below 6/month, algorithm reach decays; above 25/month requires dedicated video production capacity. In Kalyan, weekly cadence of 3-6 Reels sustains growth trajectory for scaling clinics.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is a realistic cost per Reel for a Kalyan dermatology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In-clinic filmed + agency-edited: Rs 3,500-10,000 per Reel (agency provides script + shot list + editing + captions + music + compliance review). Full agency production (agency filmed on-site): Rs 10,000-30,000 per Reel (higher production value + graphics + b-roll + interview format). Doctor-led viral series (interview + long-form + edited to shorts): Rs 20,000-60,000/session yielding 6-15 Reels. Bundled into full marketing retainer typically more cost-effective than per-Reel pricing. ITD bundles.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What compliance rules apply to dermatology Reels + viral content in Kalyan?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">ASCI medical advertising code + Maharashtra Medical Council norms apply. Compliant Reels approach: (1) education-first (explain condition/procedure without guaranteeing outcome), (2) before-after must include patient consent + individual-results-may-vary disclaimer + same lighting/angle/time, (3) no comparative claims against other clinics/products/doctors, (4) no guaranteed outcome language ('will clear your acne' → 'may help improve acne'), (5) no prescription-drug promotion, (6) testimonials with signed consent + verified. In Kalyan, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + KDMC enforcement.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do Reels drive patient inquiries for a Kalyan dermatology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Reels → profile visit → DM inquiry OR link-in-bio → WhatsApp/booking. Typical conversion funnel: 100K Reel reach → 500-2,000 profile visits → 30-150 DM inquiries → 8-40 qualified leads → 3-15 booked consultations → 2-8 treated patients (over 30-60 day cycle). Reels-attributed revenue: Rs 30,000-3 lakh per viral Reel over 30-60 day attribution window for Kalyan dermatology clinic. Compounds when Reel remains discoverable via hashtag + search for 3-12 months.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Which Reels + short-form platform matters most for Kalyan dermatology?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Instagram Reels 50-60% of allocation (primary discovery + native to buyer + brand-safe algorithm). YouTube Shorts 15-25% (long-tail discovery + evergreen + video-search-adjacent). TikTok 10-15% (growing India but ASCI-compliance uncertainty means some clinics avoid). Facebook Reels 5-10% (secondary distribution). In Kalyan with Middle-class Marathi + Gujarati + Sindhi (Ulhasnagar-adjacent) + Mumbai commuter + salaried + trader families, Instagram Reels dominant. Cross-post to YouTube Shorts + Facebook for 3x distribution at zero incremental cost.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does trending audio + hashtag strategy work for dermatology Reels?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Trending audio: match to procedure/condition topic. Trending audio Reels get 2-4x higher initial push from algorithm than original audio. Rotate through top-100 trending audio weekly. Hashtag stack: 3-5 hyperlocal (#DermatologistThane #ThaneSkinCare), 3-5 category (#DermatologistIndia #SkinCareTips), 3-5 procedure (#HydraFacial #LaserHairRemoval), 2-3 trending. In Kalyan, hyperlocal + Marathi/Hindi hashtags amplify reach.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
